      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREYA LEGEND (2) goes very well this trip starting 12 times for seven wins and four minors. Comes off a (16.66) win last time, scoring by a nose in a Grade 5 over 300m at Murray Bridge Straight. Looks a key chance on best form. HUNTSMAN (7) has a strong record this trip with eight wins and four placings from 17 starts. Comes off a (17.49) win last time, scoring by 1.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 305m at Mt Gambier. Suited here and expected to run well. RED SAID SO (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from six tries. Below best last time at this track (22.56) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 8 length fifth. Looks suited here and can measure up. BUSTER BRADY (5) is building a nice sequence of placings – hard to fault that form.",
